      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The charts of 2,719 patients from several outpatient clinics were reviewed for evidence of use and abuse of benzodiazepines. According to the chart data and interviews with physicians, no patient met the criteria for benzodiazepine abuse or dependence."},
